comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T23:21:32.081Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-10-24: canonical orientation, request-specific SDK/rollback search, fresh open and in_progress lists, and complete strict all-status read of 3083 items including 2799 closed and 14 canceled; no omissions or unreadable files. Exact GitHub issue and title checks found no existing owner for this delta. Closed SDK/bulk foundations were read live and remain completed. Source report retained in full; intake is not reproduction proof."
  "2026-10-23T23:23:04.124Z","harness:codex","Implementation plan: replace timestamp-wide restoration with guarded inverse effects proven by checkpoint-attributed immutable history. Scope attribution to the physical tracker and target item, capture it at the shared locked item writer, and check inverse-field postimages under that same lock. Failed/no-effect rows and repeated rollback must not fabricate restores. Legacy checkpoints without attribution will refuse safely and retain explicit manual history/restore recovery."
  "2026-10-23T23:33:26.955Z","harness:codex","Regression evidence: all3 initial behavior checks failed before the fix at the intended peer-title loss and false-success boundaries. The revised public SDK controls pass for both bulk commands; the focused5-file suite passes70 tests including field drift with byte-identical item/history preservation, failed-row skipping, collection/body/absent-field reversal, corrupt history, legacy refusal, direct input admission and repeat no-op. Full coverage and expanded nested-effect controls are running before closeout."
  "2026-10-23T23:47:51.772Z","harness:codex","Observability acceptance: the required recent-window Sentry/telemetry gate passes with0 critical/high unresolved issues. Four explicitly consented tracing probes produced fresh pm get/list/telemetry/contracts spans. Remote ingestion shows current command actions with paired starts/finishes for the inspected families and the physical client queue is empty. Gate aggregates; exact probe pairing; broker queue state; and rolling historical reliability are retained as separate claims."
  "2026-10-23T23:59:39.635Z","harness:codex","Full local run evidence: 11186 tests passed and4 failed across859 files. The new integration file exceeded the120-file root directory cap, so it moved into lifecycle/. Two existing tests required the standardized blank-checkpoint wording and a partial checkpoint mock. The remaining packed continuation fixture required this host npm module path; the exact NODE_PATH remedy resolves npm/package.json without source or policy changes. Focused reruns cover all four failures. Shared admission now rejects invalid rollback values before tracker/config reads and redundant unreachable blank validation was removed."
  "2026-10-24T00:11:37.462Z","harness:codex","Compatibility hardening: newly written checkpoints now use schema2. A reader expecting schema1 refuses them before any restoration; new readers also refuse legacy timestamp-only artifacts with explicit history/restore review guidance. Separate controls cover current-schema checkpoints that lack attributed recovery semantics. This prevents an older CLI from silently using its destructive rollback on a new guarded checkpoint."
  "2026-10-24T00:15:22.121Z","harness:codex","Final local behavior evidence: the schema2 focused suite passes144 tests across the changed checkpoint and lifecycle boundaries; all four initial full-run failures pass in the119-test repair rerun; the final linked recovery/context suite passes20 tests. Full local coverage previously stopped on those now-resolved failures; final hosted full-source coverage remains a required merge gate. Tracker-context-quality now exits0 across47 assertions with no blocking findings and one retained advisory. No thresholds or source populations were reduced."
